Subject: 0450_interrupt_h_cobber.patch

Origin: the psx-place PS3 patch set by Sombat Tragoongoson, a fix added after glevand's
 OtherOS++ set; the original author is not recorded. Taken from https://github.com/damiandudycz/ps3 (files/kernel-patches/psx-place-Sombat-Tragoongoson/6.12).

diff --git a/arch/powerpc/include/asm/interrupt.h b/arch/powerpc/include/asm/interrupt.h
--- a/arch/powerpc/include/asm/interrupt.h
+++ b/arch/powerpc/include/asm/interrupt.h
@@ -106,6 +106,7 @@ static inline bool is_implicit_soft_masked(struct pt_regs *regs)
 	return search_kernel_soft_mask_table(regs->nip);
 }
 
+__attribute__((always_inline))
 static inline void srr_regs_clobbered(void)
 {
 	local_paca->srr_valid = 0;
